MATLAB 验证: 应用 MATLAB 软件包, 对三组使闭环系统稳定的参数组 $(K=1, T=2), (K=2, T=0.5)$ 及 $(K=10, T=0.1)$ 作单位阶跃响应曲线, 分别如图 5-16-2、图 5-16-3 和图 5-16-4 所图5-16-1 ( G(j\omega) = \frac{K}{j\omega(1+jT\omega)(1+j\omega)} ) 概略幅相特性曲线

MATLAB程序: exe516.m

K1 = 1; T1 = 2;

G1 = tf([K1], [conv([conv([1,0],[T1,1]),[1,1])], [1,1]));

G11 = feedback(G1, 1);

K2 = 2; T2 = 0.5;

G2 = tf([K2], [conv([conv([1,0],[T2,1]),[1,1])], [1,1]));

G21 = feedback(G2, 1);

K3 = 10; T3 = 0.1;

G3 = tf([K3], [conv([conv([1,0],[T3,1]),[1,1])], [1,1]));

G31 = feedback(G3, 1);

figure(1); step(G11); grid;

figure(2); step(G21); grid;

figure(3); step(G31); grid;

